        "TileImage": "$($repository e1c8c0a5-a506-45b6-9567-7b6df50b8877).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47.\rYour target is Sheikh Omar Al-Ghazali, a member of an elite family standing in close ties with &apos;Providence&apos;.\rHaving been born in the less fortunate part of the family, he fought hard to earn himself a legacy. After one of the &apos;Providence&apos;-partners, Alexa Carlisle, left the Burj Al-Ghazali, the other partners considered appointing him as as new partner, replacing her.\rWe need to stop &apos;Providence&apos; from growing, so you have to terminate him.\rGood luck 47.\rMission status: ACTIVE",
